d.add_paragraph('The model ranks better than random but is not production-ready. Subscription prevalence rises from 5.57% in training to 38.45% in test, exposing severe temporal drift and calibration risk. The recommended next step is a small controlled ranking pilot with drift monitoring, economic thresholding, consent controls and human oversight—not autonomous targeting.')
